  {
   "text": "{\"sections\":[{\"section\":\"summary\",\"body\":\"On the bank's calculation, Datamarrow Inc is in breach of its Minimum Unrestricted Cash covenant at October 31, 2026. Unrestricted cash is {{fact:dd933902-67d2-4a16-b45e-74e0de748a96}} against a required {{fact:f333b89d-4d27-489d-9610-89b687ea4fc0}}, while the compliance certificate reports {{fact:3ebf12fc-c267-4cdd-979c-69dba2eae6b6}} and claims compliance. Minimum Runway passes, but the certificate figure differs from the bank's, and cushion on both the cash and runway covenants has declined each month since August. The cash mismatch has been escalated to committee, which holds the decision on the breach.\"},{\"section\":\"covenants\",\"body\":\"Minimum Unrestricted Cash is breached. The bank calculates {{fact:dd933902-67d2-4a16-b45e-74e0de748a96}} against a required {{fact:f333b89d-4d27-489d-9610-89b687ea4fc0}}, a cushion of {{fact:9776bf85-4868-48f0-b981-81214cd2b2f1}}. The certificate reports {{fact:3ebf12fc-c267-4cdd-979c-69dba2eae6b6}} and states compliance. Minimum Runway is compliant at {{fact:f3ab609d-f31c-4a88-997b-8c1d36d40060}} months against a required {{fact:4a0dd73f-970c-49a0-a66a-b603ca978dee}}, a cushion of {{fact:43d454bb-6fa1-4042-b1a2-57b541bb9a7e}}. The certificate reports a higher figure of {{fact:290ccbd4-7fce-4afe-853e-7e0128af1f26}}. Revenue to Plan is compliant at {{fact:b771a910-b38c-4192-8d50-cf51ba46744b}} against a required {{fact:66430163-bebc-4141-9c1d-e80a356c4d69}}, a cushion of {{fact:c09b6c1d-e57e-427b-ad81-52785dca9f20}}, and it matches the certificate's {{fact:cb02fe15-cbfe-4695-a826-bac830b4dd89}}.\"},{\"section\":\"risks\",\"body\":\"The highest-severity signal is runway below the watch level. At current burn, the borrower's ability to keep paying depends on new funding or cost reductions arriving soon. Unrestricted cash is below the covenant minimum, with a cushion of {{fact:9776bf85-4868-48f0-b981-81214cd2b2f1}}. Cash covenant headroom declined each month from August to October, which points to sustained burn rather than a one-off dip. Runway covenant headroom followed the same trend and now stands at {{fact:43d454bb-6fa1-4042-b1a2-57b541bb9a7e}}. Both work items are decided: the certificate mismatch was escalated to committee and the runway signal was acknowledged. A reviewer should establish why the certificate's cash and runway figures differ from the bank's.\"}]}",
   "type": "text"
  }
 ],
